# API Responses

## Success

`TransformResponseInterceptor`:

```json
{ "statusCode": 200, "message": "…", "data": {} }
```

- Message: `@ResponseMessage(ApiMessage.*)`
- Data shape: `@Serialize(SomeDto)`
- Lists with pages: `buildPaginatedResult('users', items, total, page, per_page)`

## Errors

`AllExceptionsFilter`:

```json
{ "statusCode": 400, "message": "…", "errors": { "field": "…" } }
```

## Rules

- Add user-facing strings to `src/common/enums/api-message.enum.ts`
- Prefer domain keys (`USER_NOT_FOUND`) over ad-hoc English in services
- Return the entity/null from handlers — never `{ success: true, … }`
